# ── LinguaRead ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app needs no build-time configuration. By default users paste their own
# Anthropic API key in the in-app Settings panel (stored only in their browser),
# and articles come from the public Wikipedia API.
#
# OPTIONAL: bake in a default Anthropic API key for the whole deployment.
# Anything in VITE_* is bundled into the client and visible to end users — only
# set this for a private/internal build, never for a public site.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
